#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cycle, Scheduler and ESS Power"
msgstr "OpenEMS-Entwicklung: Zyklus, Scheduler und Leistungsverteilung"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"xref:edge/architecture.adoc[Edge Architecture] explains the input-process-"
"output model, the Scheduler and the Process Image. This page adds the "
"details from the code. Responsible for the Cycle is the singleton component "
"`+_cycle+` (`+io.openems.edge.core+`, classes `+CycleImpl+` and "
"`+CycleWorker+`)."
msgstr ""
"xref:latest@edge/architecture.adoc[Edge Architecture] erklärt das Input-"
"Process-Output-Modell, den Scheduler und das Prozessabbild (Process Image). "
"Diese Seite ergänzt die Einzelheiten aus dem Code. Zuständig ist die "
"Singleton-Komponente `+_cycle+` (`+io.openems.edge.core+`, Klassen "
"`+CycleImpl+` und `+CycleWorker+`)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cycle time"
msgstr "Zykluszeit"

#. type: #sec-cycle-time
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Default: **1000 ms** (`+Cycle.DEFAULT_CYCLE_TIME+`), adjustable in the "
"component “Core Cycle” (field `+cycleTime+`)."
msgstr ""
"Standard: **1000 ms** (`+Cycle.DEFAULT_CYCLE_TIME+`), einstellbar in der "
"Komponente „Core Cycle“ (Feld `+cycleTime+`)."

#. type: #sec-cycle-time
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"`+_cycle/MeasuredCycleTime+` contains the time actually used by a Cycle."
msgstr ""
"`+_cycle/MeasuredCycleTime+` enthält die tatsächlich gebrauchte Zeit eines "
"Zyklus."

#. type: #sec-cycle-time
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"For troubleshooting, there is a log verbosity (`+CycleLogVerbosity+`): "
"summary, phases or individual components, each with time measurement."
msgstr ""
"Für die Fehlersuche gibt es eine Log-Ausführlichkeit "
"(`+CycleLogVerbosity+`): Zusammenfassung, Phasen oder einzelne Komponenten, "
"jeweils mit Zeitmessung."

#. type: #sec-cycle-time
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"At the beginning of each Cycle, the operating system's watchdog (systemd) is "
"notified. If the Cycle hangs, systemd can restart the service, provided the "
"watchdog is active in the service file."
msgstr ""
"Zu Beginn jedes Zyklus wird der Watchdog des Betriebssystems (systemd) "
"benachrichtigt. Hängt der Zyklus, kann systemd den Dienst neu starten, "
"sofern der Watchdog in der Service-Datei aktiv ist."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sequence of a Cycle"
msgstr "Ablauf eines Zyklus"

#. type: #sec-sequence-of-a-cycle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"The order is in `+CycleWorker.forever()+`. All Cycle Events are sent "
"synchronously via the Event Admin (`+EdgeEventConstants+`); the next step "
"only starts when all receivers have finished."
msgstr ""
"Die Reihenfolge steht in `+CycleWorker.forever()+`. Alle Ereignisse werden "
"synchron über den EventAdmin verschickt (`+EdgeEventConstants+`); der "
"nächste Schritt beginnt erst, wenn alle Empfänger fertig sind."

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| No.\n"
"| Step\n"
"| Typical use\n"
"\n"
"| 1\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_BEFORE_PROCESS_IMAGE+`\n"
"| Drivers hand over read values; Modbus Bridge completes read tasks\n"
"| 2\n"
"| **Switch Process Image**: for each enabled component (except `+_sum+`) `+channel.nextProcessImage()+`\n"
"| from here on `+value()+` returns the new values\n"
"| 3\n"
"| Calculate `+_sum+` (`+updateChannelsBeforeProcessImage()+`) and switch its Process Image\n"
"| totals match the device values just adopted\n"
"| 4\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_AFTER_PROCESS_IMAGE+`\n"
"| Components calculate derived values; with strategy `+BALANCE+`, `+_power+` rebuilds the model here\n"
"| 5\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_BEFORE_CONTROLLERS+`\n"
"| preparations before the Controllers\n"
"| 6\n"
"| **Execute Scheduler and Controllers**\n"
"| `+Controller.run()+` in Scheduler order\n"
"| 7\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_AFTER_CONTROLLERS+`\n"
"| evaluation of the Controller results\n"
"| 8\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_BEFORE_WRITE+`\n"
"| `+_power+` solves the power distribution and calls `+applyPower()+` of the ESS\n"
"| 9\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_EXECUTE_WRITE+`\n"
"| Drivers write setpoints to the devices\n"
"| 10\n"
"| Event `+TOPIC_CYCLE_AFTER_WRITE+`\n"
"| clean-up; `+_power+` (solver v1) discards the constraints of this Cycle\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nr.\n"
"| Schritt\n"
"| Typische Nutzung\n"
"\n"
"| 1\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_BEFORE_PROCESS_IMAGE+`\n"
"| Treiber übergeben gelesene Werte; Modbus-Bridge schließt Lese-Tasks ab\n"
"| 2\n"
"| **Prozessabbild wechseln**: für jede aktivierte Komponente (außer `+_sum+`) `+channel.nextProcessImage()+`\n"
"| ab hier liefert `+value()+` die neuen Werte\n"
"| 3\n"
"| `+_sum+` berechnen (`+updateChannelsBeforeProcessImage()+`) und dessen Prozessabbild wechseln\n"
"| Summen passen zu den eben übernommenen Gerätewerten\n"
"| 4\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_AFTER_PROCESS_IMAGE+`\n"
"| Komponenten berechnen abgeleitete Werte; bei Strategie `+BALANCE+` baut `+_power+` hier das Modell neu auf\n"
"| 5\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_BEFORE_CONTROLLERS+`\n"
"| Vorbereitungen vor den Controllern\n"
"| 6\n"
"| **Scheduler und Controller ausführen**\n"
"| `+Controller.run()+` in Scheduler-Reihenfolge\n"
"| 7\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_AFTER_CONTROLLERS+`\n"
"| Auswertung der Controller-Ergebnisse\n"
"| 8\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_BEFORE_WRITE+`\n"
"| `+_power+` löst die Leistungsverteilung und ruft `+applyPower()+` der Speicher auf\n"
"| 9\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_EXECUTE_WRITE+`\n"
"| Treiber schreiben Sollwerte an die Geräte\n"
"| 10\n"
"| Ereignis `+TOPIC_CYCLE_AFTER_WRITE+`\n"
"| Aufräumen; `+_power+` (Solver v1) verwirft die Bedingungen dieses Zyklus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"An exception anywhere in this sequence only aborts the current Cycle; it is "
"logged as “Error in Scheduler …” (with stack trace for "
"`+NullPointerException+` and `+ClassCastException+`). The next Cycle starts "
"normally."
msgstr ""
"Eine Ausnahme irgendwo in diesem Ablauf bricht nur den aktuellen Zyklus ab; "
"sie wird als „Error in Scheduler …“ geloggt (bei `+NullPointerException+` "
"und `+ClassCastException+` mit Stacktrace). Der nächste Zyklus beginnt "
"normal."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduler and Controllers"
msgstr "Scheduler und Controller"

#. type: #sec-scheduler-and-controllers
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Without a Scheduler, no Controllers run; the log then reports “There are no "
"Schedulers configured!”."
msgstr ""
"Ohne Scheduler laufen keine Controller; das Log meldet dann „There are no "
"Schedulers configured!“."

#. type: #sec-scheduler-and-controllers
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Several Schedulers are possible; they run sorted by their Component-ID. Each "
"Scheduler provides an ordered list of Controller IDs via `+getControllers()"
"+`."
msgstr ""
"Mehrere Scheduler sind möglich; sie laufen nach ihrer Komponenten-ID "
"sortiert. Jeder Scheduler liefert über `+getControllers()+` eine geordnete "
"Liste von Controller-IDs."

#. type: #sec-scheduler-and-controllers
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Available Schedulers: `+allalphabetically+` (optionally a fixed list first, "
"then all other Controllers alphabetically by ID), `+fixedorder+` (fixed "
"list), `+daily+` (by time of day), `+jscalendar+` (by calendar rules)."
msgstr ""
"Vorhandene Scheduler: `+allalphabetically+` (optional eine feste Liste "
"zuerst, danach alle übrigen Controller alphabetisch nach ID), `+fixedorder+` "
"(feste Liste), `+daily+` (nach Uhrzeit), `+jscalendar+` (nach "
"Kalenderregeln)."

#. type: #sec-scheduler-and-controllers
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"If a Controller is missing or the ID is not a Controller, the Scheduler sets "
"its State-Channel `+ControllerIsMissing+`."
msgstr ""
"Fehlt ein Controller oder ist die ID kein Controller, setzt der Scheduler "
"seinen State-Channel `+ControllerIsMissing+`."

#. type: #sec-scheduler-and-controllers
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"A disabled Controller is skipped; `+_cycle/IgnoreDisabledController+` is set."
msgstr ""
"Ein deaktivierter Controller wird übersprungen; `+_cycle/"
"IgnoreDisabledController+` wird gesetzt."

#. type: #sec-scheduler-and-controllers
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"If `+run()+` throws an exception, it is logged, the State-Channel "
"`+RunFailed+` (level FAULT) of the Controller is set and the next Controller "
"is executed."
msgstr ""
"Wirft `+run()+` eine Ausnahme, wird sie geloggt, der State-Channel "
"`+RunFailed+` (Level FAULT) des Controllers gesetzt und der nächste "
"Controller ausgeführt."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Meaning of the order"
msgstr "Bedeutung der Reihenfolge"

#. type: #sec-meaning-of-the-order
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Controllers that set ESS setpoints work via **constraints** of the power "
"distribution. An earlier Controller can set constraints that later ones must "
"comply with. Example: a Controller for § 14a sets a maximum charging power; "
"a self-consumption Controller running later then receives at most this "
"value. Limiting Controllers therefore come **before** optimizing ones in the "
"order. Details on § 14a are on the user page xref:user/storage-control/"
"section-14a-enwg.adoc[§ 14a]."
msgstr ""
"Controller, die Speicher-Sollwerte setzen, arbeiten über **Grenzen** "
"(Constraints) der Leistungsverteilung. Ein früherer Controller kann Grenzen "
"setzen, die spätere einhalten müssen. Beispiel: Ein Controller für §14a "
"setzt eine Höchstladeleistung; ein später laufender Eigenverbrauchs-"
"Controller erhält dann höchstens diesen Wert. Daher stehen begrenzende "
"Controller in der Reihenfolge **vor** optimierenden. Einzelheiten zu §14a "
"beschreibt die Anwenderseite xref:user/storage-control/section-14a-"
"enwg.adoc[§14a]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "ESS Power (`+_power+`)"
msgstr "Leistungsverteilung (`+_power+`)"

#. type: #sec-ess-power-power
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"ESS (`+ManagedSymmetricEss+`) do not have setpoints written directly. "
"Controllers set constraints, and the component `+_power+` (bundle "
"`+io.openems.edge.ess.core+`, “ESS Power”) solves them together for all ESS."
msgstr ""
"Speicher (`+ManagedSymmetricEss+`) bekommen keine Sollwerte direkt "
"geschrieben. Controller setzen Bedingungen, die Komponente `+_power+` "
"(Bundle `+io.openems.edge.ess.core+`, „ESS Power“) löst sie gemeinsam für "
"alle Speicher."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting constraints"
msgstr "Bedingungen setzen"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method on the ESS\n"
"| Channel\n"
"| Constraint\n"
"\n"
"| `+setActivePowerEqualsWithFilter(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerEquals+`\n"
"| power = p, with control filter\n"
"| `+setActivePowerEqualsWithoutFilter(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerEquals+`\n"
"| power = p, without filter\n"
"| `+setActivePowerLessOrEquals(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerLessOrEquals+`\n"
"| power ≤ p\n"
"| `+setActivePowerGreaterOrEquals(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerGreaterOrEquals+`\n"
"| power ≥ p\n"
"| accordingly `+…ReactivePower…+`\n"
"| \n"
"| reactive power\n"
msgstr ""
"| Methode am Speicher\n"
"| Channel\n"
"| Bedingung\n"
"\n"
"| `+setActivePowerEqualsWithFilter(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerEquals+`\n"
"| Leistung = p, mit Regelfilter\n"
"| `+setActivePowerEqualsWithoutFilter(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerEquals+`\n"
"| Leistung = p, ohne Filter\n"
"| `+setActivePowerLessOrEquals(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerLessOrEquals+`\n"
"| Leistung ≤ p\n"
"| `+setActivePowerGreaterOrEquals(p)+`\n"
"| `+SetActivePowerGreaterOrEquals+`\n"
"| Leistung ≥ p\n"
"| entsprechend `+…ReactivePower…+`\n"
"| \n"
"| Blindleistung\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Signs: **negative = charge, positive = discharge**. Writing to one of these "
"Channels immediately creates a constraint at the solver via "
"`+onChannelSetNextWrite+`."
msgstr ""
"Vorzeichen: **negativ = Laden, positiv = Entladen**. Das Schreiben in einen "
"dieser Channels legt über `+onChannelSetNextWrite+` sofort eine Bedingung "
"beim Solver an."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"**With filter** for closed control loops that react to a grid meter (e.g. "
"self-consumption optimization). The filter prevents oscillation."
msgstr ""
"**Mit Filter** für geschlossene Regelkreise, die auf einen Netzzähler "
"reagieren (z. B. Eigenverbrauchsoptimierung). Der Filter verhindert "
"Schwingen."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"**Without filter** if the value comes directly from a higher-level "
"Controller or from the user."
msgstr ""
"**Ohne Filter**, wenn der Wert direkt von einem übergeordneten Controller "
"oder vom Benutzer kommt."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"For your own constraints, there is `+addPowerConstraint(…)+` or "
"`+addPowerConstraintAndValidate(…)+`; the latter throws an exception if the "
"constraint is incompatible with the previous ones."
msgstr ""
"Für eigene Bedingungen gibt es `+addPowerConstraint(…)+` bzw. "
"`+addPowerConstraintAndValidate(…)+`; letzteres wirft eine Ausnahme, wenn "
"die Bedingung mit den bisherigen nicht vereinbar ist."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"`+getPower().getMaxPower(…)+` and `+getMinPower(…)+` return the leeway that "
"remains after the previous constraints."
msgstr ""
"`+getPower().getMaxPower(…)+` und `+getMinPower(…)+` liefern den Spielraum, "
"der nach den bisherigen Bedingungen noch bleibt."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solving and applying"
msgstr "Lösen und Anwenden"

#. type: #sec-solving-and-applying
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Constraints only apply for one Cycle. Solver v1 discards them after writing "
"(step 10) and creates the static limits of the ESS anew "
"(`+getStaticConstraints()+`, e.g. permitted charging/discharging power); "
"solver v2 rebuilds its model after the Process Image is switched (step 4). A "
"Controller must therefore set its setpoints anew in every Cycle."
msgstr ""
"Bedingungen gelten nur für einen Zyklus. Solver v1 verwirft sie nach dem "
"Schreiben (Schritt 10) und legt die statischen Grenzen der Speicher "
"(`+getStaticConstraints()+`, z. B. erlaubte Lade-/Entladeleistung) neu an; "
"Solver v2 baut sein Modell nach dem Wechsel des Prozessabbilds (Schritt 4) "
"neu auf. Ein Controller muss seine Sollwerte also in jedem Zyklus neu setzen."

#. type: #sec-solving-and-applying
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Solving takes place before writing (step 8). Each ESS receives the result "
"via `+applyPower(activePower, reactivePower)+`; the driver converts it into "
"device registers. Rounding is done to `+getPowerPrecision()+`."
msgstr ""
"Vor dem Schreiben (Schritt 8) wird gelöst. Jeder Speicher erhält das "
"Ergebnis über `+applyPower(activePower, reactivePower)+`; der Treiber setzt "
"es in Geräte-Register um. Gerundet wird auf `+getPowerPrecision()+`."

#. type: #sec-solving-and-applying
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"If no solution is possible, the State-Channel `+_power/NotSolved+` (level "
"WARNING) is set."
msgstr ""
"Ist keine Lösung möglich, wird der State-Channel `+_power/NotSolved+` (Level "
"WARNING) gesetzt."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Strategies and filters"
msgstr "Strategien und Filter"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Setting\n"
"| Default\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"\n"
"| `+strategy+`\n"
"| `+OPTIMIZE_BY_MOVING_TOWARDS_TARGET+`\n"
"| distribution across several ESS. All strategies except `+BALANCE+` use solver v1 (linear optimization); `+BALANCE+` uses the newer solver v2 (`+TreeSolver+`).\n"
"| `+enablePid+`\n"
"| on\n"
"| PID filter for “with filter” setpoints; parameters `+p+`, `+i+`, `+d+`\n"
"| `+enablePT1Filter+`\n"
"| off\n"
"| PT1 filter instead of PID (only if PID is off), time constant `+pt1TimeConstant+`\n"
"| `+symmetricMode+`\n"
"| on\n"
"| keeps asymmetric ESS symmetric\n"
"| `+debugMode+`\n"
"| off\n"
"| additional log output of the solver\n"
msgstr ""
"| Einstellung\n"
"| Standard\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"\n"
"| `+strategy+`\n"
"| `+OPTIMIZE_BY_MOVING_TOWARDS_TARGET+`\n"
"| Verteilung auf mehrere Speicher. Alle Strategien außer `+BALANCE+` nutzen den Solver v1 (lineare Optimierung); `+BALANCE+` nutzt den neueren Solver v2 (`+TreeSolver+`).\n"
"| `+enablePid+`\n"
"| an\n"
"| PID-Filter für „mit Filter“-Sollwerte; Parameter `+p+`, `+i+`, `+d+`\n"
"| `+enablePT1Filter+`\n"
"| aus\n"
"| PT1-Filter statt PID (nur wenn PID aus), Zeitkonstante `+pt1TimeConstant+`\n"
"| `+symmetricMode+`\n"
"| an\n"
"| hält asymmetrische Speicher symmetrisch\n"
"| `+debugMode+`\n"
"| aus\n"
"| zusätzliche Log-Ausgaben des Solvers\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes for your own code"
msgstr "Hinweise für eigenen Code"

#. type: #sec-notes-for-your-own-code
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"In `+run()+`, only work with `+value()+`, not with `+getNextValue()+`; "
"otherwise the Controller sees a value that other Controllers do not yet see "
"in the same Cycle."
msgstr ""
"In `+run()+` nur mit `+value()+` arbeiten, nicht mit `+getNextValue()+`; "
"sonst sieht der Controller einen Wert, den andere Controller im selben "
"Zyklus noch nicht sehen."

#. type: #sec-notes-for-your-own-code
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"A value that a Controller writes to a Channel (`+_setNextValue+`) can only "
"be read via `+value()+` in the next Cycle."
msgstr ""
"Ein Wert, den ein Controller in einen Channel schreibt (`+_setNextValue+`), "
"ist erst im nächsten Zyklus über `+value()+` lesbar."

#. type: #sec-notes-for-your-own-code
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc
msgid ""
"Slow work (network, calculations over many seconds) belongs in a separate "
"thread or worker (`+AbstractWorker+`, `+AbstractCycleWorker+`), not in "
"`+run()+` or a Cycle Event. All events run synchronously and extend the "
"Cycle."
msgstr ""
"Langsame Arbeit (Netzwerk, Berechnungen über viele Sekunden) gehört in einen "
"eigenen Thread oder Worker (`+AbstractWorker+`, `+AbstractCycleWorker+`), "
"nicht in `+run()+` oder ein Zyklus-Ereignis. Alle Ereignisse laufen synchron "
"und verlängern den Zyklus."
